; Ruler for placing the START/END label text (_MARKER_X in test_console.py).
; A tick every 25 dots across, tall and numbered every 50. Same stock setup
; and rotation as MARKER.prn, so a photo of this label shows where each x
; lands. The top row is the marker label's widest row, at its current x (150).
